    "Automatic refresh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动刷新"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic refresh is on (upstream's default): each apply also writes PBF_RESET_FILE_PROTECTIONS, which is what makes PosterBoard re-read the store at boot. Turn it off to leave the device's preferences alone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "自动刷新已开启（上游默认）：每次应用都会写入 PBF_RESET_FILE_PROTECTIONS，使 PosterBoard 在启动时重新读取存储。关闭后不会改动设备偏好。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Battery": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "电池"
