      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱包"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallet Cards (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱包卡片（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpaper packs (%lld)": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸包（%lld）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpaper presets": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸预设"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wallpapers are delivered as files into this app's own backup of the device, in the %@ domain — the same channel the tweaks use. Nothing is written to the device until Apply.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "壁纸以文件形式进入本 App 为设备所做的备份，写入 %@ 域 — 与插件使用同一通道。在点按“应用”之前不会写入设备。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Warnings": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "警告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Weight": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "粗细"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wi-Fi Signal Bars": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wi-Fi 信号格"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Working space": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "工作空间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes %lld file(s) to the device:": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 %lld 个文件写入设备："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist. Disabling a daemon stops its service. Only the %lld labels shown here can ever reach the file.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "写入 /var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist。停用守护进程会停止其服务。只有此处显示的 %lld 个标签可能被写入该文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes a 0-byte file over %@. Upstream models this as a NullifyFileTweak: it removes a plist rather than writing one.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在 %@ 上写入 0 字节文件。上游将其建模为 NullifyFileTweak：移除 plist 而不是写入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Writes the descriptors into %@ over a tunnel and resprings, so it is live in seconds. No backup is taken, because nothing is delivered back to the device — but for the same reason it applies **only** the packs: tweaks need the backup, so they still go through the **Apply** button on the home page.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通过隧道把描述文件写入 %@ 并注销，几秒内即可生效。不会创建备份，因为不会向设备回传任何内容 — 同理，它**只**应用壁纸包：插件需要备份，仍需通过首页的**应用**按钮。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Yesterday, %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "昨天，%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can get more tweaks, but they are untested with your iOS version. You can change your mind in Settings.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "可获取更多插件，但未在你的 iOS 版本测试过。可在设置中更改。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You're up to date.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已是最新版本"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Your selection is saved to %@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "Your selection is saved to %1$@ on every change and restored on launch, exactly as the desktop app's AutoSave preset does (%2$@). Import is for a preset from elsewhere; entries this port does not carry are listed below rather than guessed at."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的选择会在每次更改时保存到 %@，并在启动时恢复，与桌面版的自动保存预设完全一致（%@）。导入用于来自其他位置的预设；本移植未支持的条目会在下方列出，而不是猜测填充。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS %@: each nulled file is written as a valid empty plist, not 0 bytes. A 0-byte plist is a truncated plist on this release and crashes SpringBoard at boot. An empty plist parses, and the system falls back to its own defaults.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS %@：每个置空文件都会写成合法的空 plist，而不是 0 字节。此版本中 0 字节 plist 属于截断的 plist，会导致 SpringBoard 启动崩溃。空 plist 可以解析，系统会回退到自身默认值。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 builds the depth effect only for the modern (“Clownfish”) layout, so a pack made before iOS 27 is rewritten when it is applied — otherwise it installs and looks flat, with no depth. The rewrite re-stamps the family, drops external scripts and republishes the planes, and it is best effort: it can change how a wallpaper looks. A pack holding nothing pre-27 is left alone either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只为现代（“Clownfish”）布局构建景深效果，因此在 iOS 27 之前制作的包会在应用时被重写 — 否则安装后看起来是平的，没有景深。重写会重新标记家族、丢弃外部脚本并重新发布各图层，且属于尽力而为：可能改变壁纸的观感。不含 pre-27 内容的包在两种情况下都不处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 only applies the depth effect to wallpapers in the modern format, so a legacy wallpaper is rewritten on import. Pick “Install as is” to push the original files untouched instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只对现代格式的壁纸应用景深效果，因此旧版壁纸会在导入时被重写。选择“按原样安装”则原样推送文件，不做改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 status bar research": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 状态栏研究"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27+ — on iOS 26, use a file from a computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27+ — iOS 26 请用电脑生成的文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "nothing saved yet": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "尚未保存任何内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "saved": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已保存"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "statusBarOverrides struct, so every override reads as off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "statusBarOverrides 结构体，因此所有覆盖都读作关闭。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the classic struct": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "经典结构体"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the iOS 27 archive": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 归档"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "tunnel: %@ · peer %@:%u reachable: %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "tunnel: %1$@ · peer %2$@:%3$u reachable: %4$@"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道：%@ · 对端 %@:%u 可达：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "value": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "取值"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "working…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "处理中…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "≈ %@ remaining": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "≈ 剩余 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "≈ %lld min": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "≈ %lld 分钟"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠ Low battery: %lld%%. Connect the charger before restoring.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠ 电量低：%lld%%。请先连接充电器再恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠ Low storage: %.1f GB free. Restoring tweaks may require at least %.1f GB free and could fail if the device runs out of space.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "⚠ Low storage: %1$.1f GB free. Restoring tweaks may require at least %2$.1f GB free and could fail if the device runs out of space."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠ 存储不足：%.1f GB 可用。恢复插件可能至少需要 %.1f GB 可用空间，空间耗尽会导致失败。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "⚠️ A PosterBoard reset is armed (%@). A reset run clears the store and installs no wallpapers, so with wallpapers selected as well Apply refuses until one of the two is turned off.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "⚠️ 已启用 PosterBoard 重置（%@）。重置会清空存储且不安装壁纸，因此若同时选择了壁纸，“应用”会被拒绝，直到关闭其中一项。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Advertising \"%@\" — waiting for this iPhone to connect…": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在广播“%@” — 等待此 iPhone 连接…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm it in Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode → \"Pair with %@\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式 →“与 %@ 配对” 中确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Confirm this PIN in Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode → \"Pair with %@\" to finish pairing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请在 设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式 →“与 %@ 配对” 中确认此 PIN 以完成配对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Connect this iPhone over USB and tap Trust, then open GoldenNugget on the computer — iOS → \"GoldenNugget Mobile Helper\". It installs the app and sends the pairing file itself.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用 USB 连接此 iPhone 并点按“信任”，然后在电脑上打开 GoldenNugget — iOS → “GoldenNugget Mobile Helper”。它会安装 App 并自动发送配对文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this open, then above on this iPhone: Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode → \"Pair with %@\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持此页面打开，然后在此 iPhone 上操作：设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式 →“与 %@ 配对”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Leave this screen open, then open Settings → Privacy & Security → Developer Mode on this iPhone and tap \"Pair with %@\". iOS 27 connects the phone to the advertised service itself — no computer is involved.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "保持此页面打开，然后在此 iPhone 上打开 设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 开发者模式 并点按“与 %@ 配对”。iOS 27 会自行连接所广播的服务 — 无需电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Nothing matches \"%@\".": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "没有匹配“%@”的内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 builds the depth effect only for the modern (\"Clownfish\") layout, so a pack made before iOS 27 is rewritten when it is applied — otherwise it installs and looks flat, with no depth. The rewrite re-stamps the family, drops external scripts and republishes the planes, and it is best effort: it can change how a wallpaper looks. A pack holding nothing pre-27 is left alone either way.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只为现代（“Clownfish”）布局构建景深效果，因此在 iOS 27 之前制作的包会在应用时被重写 — 否则安装后看起来是平的，没有景深。重写会重新标记家族、丢弃外部脚本并重新发布各图层，且属于尽力而为：可能改变壁纸的观感。不含 pre-27 内容的包在两种情况下都不处理。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 27 only applies the depth effect to wallpapers in the modern format, so a legacy wallpaper is rewritten on import. Pick \"Install as is\" to push the original files untouched instead.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "iOS 27 只对现代格式的壁纸应用景深效果，因此旧版壁纸会在导入时被重写。选择“按原样安装”则原样推送文件，不做改动。"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}
